.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK COMMENT ADD"
.SH NAME
hamstik work comment add \- Add a comment to a work item
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work comment add [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a comment to a work item
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body
Comment body
.TP
.B --body-file
Comment body source (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --body-editor
Author the body in $VISUAL/$EDITOR instead of passing text
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --parent
Parent comment UUID (for replies)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
